	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Sheet: Power\n\nPurpose: Power input, OR-ing, protection and 3.3 V regulation\n\nPlanned contents:\n  - J: Micro USB 10118194-0001LF (VBUS, D+/D- routed to MCU sheet)\n  - Ideal-diode OR: LM66100DCKR x2 so USB VBUS and SPI-line power never touch\n  - Reverse-voltage, ESD and overcurrent/short protection (fuse or eFuse)\n  - U: AP2112K-3.3 LDO, 3.3 V rail for the whole board\n  - Power-good LED\n  - NOTE: board power budget and 6-board chain budget go here\n  -       (only one board's LED array active at a time)"
